### 广告投放预算超投止损系统 API 测试

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. 获取广告主列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/advertisers

### 3. 获取所有投放计划列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans

### 4. 按状态筛选计划 (止损中)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans?status=止损中

### 5. 获取计划详情 (查看完整流转记录 plan6)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/[替换为实际的plan6 ID]

### 6. 获取计划历史记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/[替换为实际的plan6 ID]/history

### 7. 检查预算超支情况
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/[替换为实际的plan1 ID]/check-budget

### 8. 导出计划数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/[替换为实际的plan6 ID]/export

### 9. 触发止损 (正常流)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans/[替换为实际的plan1 ID]/trigger-stop-loss
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operatorId": "op-003",
  "operatorName": "测试操作员"
}

### 10. 驳回止损 (驳回流 - 冲突记录)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans/[替换为实际的plan3 ID]/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operatorId": "mgr-003",
  "operatorName": "测试经理",
  "reason": "驳回原因：数据统计有误，需要重新核对"
}

### 11. 人工复核 (人工复核流 - 通过)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans/[替换为实际的plan3 ID]/manual-review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operatorId": "mgr-003",
  "operatorName": "测试经理",
  "approved": true,
  "reason": "人工复核通过，确认超投，启动补偿流程"
}

### 12. 关闭计划
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans/[替换为实际的plan5 ID]/close
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operatorId": "op-003",
  "operatorName": "测试操作员"
}

### 13. 批量导入消耗回传 (包含坏行测试)
POST {{baseUrl}}/spend-callbacks/batch-import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": [
    {
      "planId": "不存在的计划ID",
      "spendAmount": 5000,
      "callbackTime": "2024-06-15T10:00:00Z",
      "callbackSource": "测试导入"
    },
    {
      "planId": "[替换为实际的plan2 ID]",
      "spendAmount": 3000,
      "callbackTime": "2024-06-10T08:00:00Z",
      "callbackSource": "测试导入-延迟回传"
    },
    {
      "planId": "[替换为实际的plan2 ID]",
      "spendAmount": 1000,
      "callbackTime": "2024-06-15T09:00:00Z",
      "callbackSource": "测试导入-正常"
    }
  ]
}
